      "writtenOn": "2023-10-16T13:55:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ennn, [RFC 1035 2.3.4](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc1035#section-2.3.4) and [RFC 1035 3.2.1](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc1035#section-3.2.1) say it\u0027s a signed integer, but [RFC 1035 4.1.3](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc1035#section-4.1.3) says it\u0027s n unsigned integer...\n\nAnyway, I updated it to use `long` to be be consistent with avahi and mDNSResponder (they use `uint32_t` for TTL).",
